Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs25\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord1.5\pos(128.8,58.667)}The Bakery Tongs, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.06,0:00:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You know tongs, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the ones at bakeries?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, bakery tongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think those are kind of hard to use?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.02,0:00:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you grip too hard, \Nit feels like you're gonna crush the bread,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,and yet if you grip too softly, \Nit feels like you're gonna drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't they just way too bad at transferring force?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, tsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, don't you guys ever not know whether it's the right way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to grab bread with tongs vertically or horizontally,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,even though you've gone out of your way to come to a bakery?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like this is all the tongs' fault, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mogura.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you being pretty rude to the tongs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering about that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should apologize to the tongs once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't even be able to go to a bakery anymore, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better apologize. \NYou never know where tongs are watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:00:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,See, it just clicked right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.03,0:00:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.06,0:01:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how you apologize to tongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.94,0:01:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm extremely sor—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, not politely or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.60,0:01:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? How-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't communicate with tongs \Nunless you speak Tongese.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tongese?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.16,0:01:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Tongese?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I mean tongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.03,0:01:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you making fun of the tongs?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not making fun of them, tong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no tongs here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.80,0:01:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I heard a click just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, it's just your imagination, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.68,0:01:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because I made fun of the tongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.16,0:01:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry tongs, sorry tongs, sorry tongs, \Nsorry tongs, sorry tongs!
